  "description": "*Just how big is it?*\n\nOn a lazy weekend afternoon, Na-Ri was relaxing when her brother Jun-U burst in, all excited, and told her something shocking she hadn’t even been curious about. It was about how impressive her childhood friend Seong-Jun’s was. Na-Ri grimaced, clearly displeased at hearing such information. Then, as Jun-U was heading out, he asked her to bring back a hat Seong-Jun had forgotten. With no other choice, she headed to Seong-Jun's house. Arriving and seeing Seong-Jun asleep, a tiny spark of curiosity ignited in Na-Ri. Unable to resist her curiosity, her footsteps carried her toward the sleeping Seong-Jun...\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated) \n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Dongjeongnam Danpyeonseon (동정남 단편선) Collection.*",
